This backend repository handles all the server-side logic and API endpoints for the Dolt
 platform. It includes a variety of routes such as:

Auth Routes: Endpoints for user authentication and profile management, including signup, login, logout, verify, update profile, and account switching.

Product and Service Routes: Manage all the product and service-related data.

Booking Routes: Handle bookings and appointments between users and providers.

Earning Routes: Track and manage earnings for service providers.

Admin Dashboard Routes: Routes dedicated to admin functionalities and oversight.